        "id": 5631
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-02-29T15:05:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Here, I think we might be doing the right thing, too? We are explicitly passing the old and new devices, so `internalDrawDeviceWithFilter` will apply the backdrop filter in the layer\u0027s color-space (which again, feels consistent if we assume we always filter in the color space of the destination device). It still might be confusing to a user, but we can at least document it.",
      "revId": "0c21de5fcd9874c5570433d31fb869630ee0c192",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
